/*! \page sdk_observer_authority Spectrum Observer and Authority

Markdown companion: \c docs/observer_authority.md.

\section sdk_obs_rules Rules

- Zero map/quiet capability bits => observer: consume only, emit no result.
- One active result authority across native and process placements.
- Observer result is a protocol/security violation: routes withdrawn, incident.
- Cross-dApp composition uses host-owned caches only.

Reference observer: \c ref_spectrum_observerd_cpu.

*/
